WEBVTT

00:00:59.823 --> 00:01:02.759
This is the story of what happened next

00:01:02.793 --> 00:01:05.062
and what we all can learn from it.

00:01:06.063 --> 00:01:07.564
I want you to stop for a second

00:01:07.598 --> 00:01:10.601
and listen to the story
going on in your head.

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:13.670
It's there, somewhere, in the background.

00:01:14.137 --> 00:01:17.274
It's the story you tell others
when you first meet them,

00:01:17.307 --> 00:01:19.843
the story you tell yourself every day.

00:01:20.544 --> 00:01:22.813
It's the story of who you are,

00:01:22.846 --> 00:01:25.482
where you came from, where you're going.

00:01:25.816 --> 00:01:27.985
It's the story of your life.

00:01:29.219 --> 00:01:31.755
What we've learned
from a generation of brain research